From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Go08er <149829787+Go08er@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 11:00:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] winewayland: Advertise Wine VR device extensions

WineVulkan handles VK_WINE_openvr_device_extensions and
VK_WINE_openxr_device_extensions as driver capabilities before translating
them to the host runtime requirements. Match the X11 driver and advertise
those capabilities from WineWayland so DXVK and VKD3D-Proton can request
the Wine VR bridge extensions without failing device creation with
VK_ERROR_EXTENSION_NOT_PRESENT.

Ported from Proton-RTSP-Wayland-GE
patches/winewayland-advertise-wine-vr-device-extensions.patch (Alpha 4+,
retained through Beta 4) onto GE-Proton11-9 Wine base 981e2f0b9007.
---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/vulkan.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/vulkan.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/vulkan.c
index 4d84f33ae6..41ce6d4738 100644
--- a/dlls/winewayland.drv/vulkan.c
+++ b/dlls/winewayland.drv/vulkan.c
@@ -90,6 +90,8 @@ static void wayland_map_device_extensions(struct vulkan_device_extensions *exten
     if (extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_semaphore_fd) extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_semaphore_win32 = 1;
     if (extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_fence_win32) extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_fence_fd = 1;
     if (extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_fence_fd) extensions->has_VK_KHR_external_fence_win32 = 1;
+    extensions->has_VK_WINE_openvr_device_extensions = 1;
+    extensions->has_VK_WINE_openxr_device_extensions = 1;
 }

 static const struct vulkan_driver_funcs wayland_vulkan_driver_funcs =
